---
---

<section id="donate" class="py-24 bg-gradient-to-br from-secondary-700 to-primary-700">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white mb-4">
      Help a Sapling Grow
    </h2>
    <p class="text-lg text-white/80 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10 leading-relaxed">
      Your support — whether as a donor or volunteer — directly funds free AI
      workshops, open curricula, and mentorship for students who need it most.
      Every contribution plants a new seed.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
      <a
        href="/donate"
        class="px-8 py-4 rounded-full bg-white text-primary-700 font-bold text-lg hover:bg-primary-50 transition-all shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-0.5 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-white focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-offset-primary-700"
      >
        💚 Donate Now
      </a>
      <a
        href="#contact"
        class="px-8 py-4 rounded-full border-2 border-white text-white font-bold text-lg hover:bg-white/10 transition-all shadow-md hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-0.5 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-white focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-offset-secondary-700"
      >
        🙋 Join as Volunteer
      </a>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-8 text-sm text-white/60">
      InspireSaplingAI is a registered non-profit. Donations may be tax-deductible.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
